CATALINA (Python port)
Copyright 2026 Guido Averna, Massimo Cossentino, Giovanni Pilato, ICAR-CNR

This product is a Python port of CATALINA_Model (Java, branch V0.3, "Case Study
Journal 001"), https://github.com/CATALINA-Architecture/catalina_model,
distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
This port changes the language (Java to Python), replaces the Swing GUI with a
browser GUI and a simulated clock, adds scenarios and an experiment harness, and
uses the updated Beliefs.xml and an empty Critical_Beliefs.xml supplied by the
author of the Java code.
